scenario: SND-EAR-02
title: Volume keys and the master volume
area: Sound
rows: F-SND-04, F-KBD-01
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: Sound plays (open RADIO, pick a station, or use the test tone in Settings, Sound).
step: Press the keyboard's volume up key three times, then the volume down key three times.
expect: A volume indicator appears each time and the loudness follows the keys you press, up and then back down to where it began.
clause: F-KBD-01.keys
step: Open Settings, Sound while the sound is playing and look at the slider.
expect: The slider shows the same volume the keys set. Moving it changes what you hear at once.
clause: F-SND-04.one-volume
step: Mute with the key, then change the volume with the slider.
expect: The sound stays muted until you unmute, or the mute ends in a way the screen explains; no sound comes out silently stuck at an unknown state.
clause: F-SND-04.mute-slider
